00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.230
So this is one way to easily
remember how to use this.

00:03:45.239 --> 00:03:48.540
So you see that MC delta T, think MCAT.

00:03:48.999 --> 00:03:50.579
So how can we use this?

00:03:50.579 --> 00:03:53.079
Well, let's go over what
each of these letters mean.

00:03:53.439 --> 00:03:57.239
So when we see the letter Q,
this is referring to heat.

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:59.530
Which is a form of energy.

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:05.550
Okay, so now that energy value is we're
going to be measuring that in joules So

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:09.699
if you think of jewel like the vape pen,
it's not the same spelling It's jewel as

00:04:09.699 --> 00:04:13.100
in j o u l e e as the for the unit, right?

