00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:17.630
I'm kind of blocking that a little bit.

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:21.819
Okay, so we have all of our
values here, so what we will do

00:10:21.829 --> 00:10:25.680
is take 5500 grams, times it by 4.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:29.420
186, times it by negative 5.

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:35.810
3, and what we will get in the end is a
negative Q value, which is going to be in

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:41.165
joules, and we will get negative 122 0.

00:10:42.755 --> 00:10:43.425
21.

00:10:43.525 --> 00:10:44.275
19 or 0.

00:10:44.305 --> 00:10:46.765
9 joules for our answer.

00:10:47.195 --> 00:10:48.925
Now is this really the
way that you want it?

00:10:48.945 --> 00:10:52.055
Well, earlier it mentioned
